tifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","title":"AsyncSequences","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences"}}}